Z||000000||hugh||03-11-2001||03:26 PM||||If any of you are using or about to use the spray foam that comes in a can.WARNING!!I had to finish a refrigeration job today and used a can of foam.When you use it a little will come out the end after you stop spraying it.I didn't notice it,but a little fell into my shoe.After a short time my right shoe felt funny.When I checked it my sock,shoe,and the bottom of my pant leg were glued together.What a pain in the ass.I hope that my story saves some of you the pain and embarrassment of being foamed to something.  ||||reg||1
